"首次启用需要照片访问权限。有限权限只扫描已授权范围；启用配置与确认关联按服务器和账号隔离保存。以后启动恢复并自动刷新，照片库变化会使旧关联失效。" = "Photos permission is required on first use. Limited access scans only authorized photos. Preferences and confirmed matches are saved per server and account, restored on launch, and invalidated when the library changes.";
"高：%@" = "Height: %@";
"默认" = "Default";
"默认关闭。开启后只使用最近扫描保存的相簿、排除与 iCloud 选项；允许 iCloud 的已保存设置可能下载原片。默认仅处理安全的新项和未尝试项；连接失败重核须另行同意下方选项，其他失败、已尝试暂停及取消项仍需手动处理。手动停止会关闭并保存自动规则。" = "Off by default. Uses albums, exclusions, and iCloud options saved by the latest scan; allowing iCloud may download originals. Only safe new and unattempted items run automatically. Network recovery requires separate consent. Other failures and cancellations need manual review. Stopping disables and saves automatic rules.";
"默认关闭。开启后在前台，或已开启系统后台备份的有效租约内，将安全新项目补入已映射目标。使用保存包含/排除，不创建相簿，不重放未知/失败/取消项，不为组织上传或下载原片。" = "Off by default. Add safe new relationships to mapped albums in the foreground or during valid background backup time. Uses saved selections and exclusions. No album creation, unknown-result retries, or original transfers for organization.";
"默认关闭公共坐标查询。地图瓦片仍按服务器配置的地图源加载。" = "Public coordinate lookup is off by default. Map tiles still use the server-configured source.";
"默认关闭，独立于前台开关。iOS 可延后运行；后台只使用保存的相簿、排除和 iCloud 选项，失败或未知历史保持待核查。系统到期会暂停并保存回执。" = "Off by default and separate from foreground backup. iOS may delay execution. Uses saved albums, exclusions, and iCloud options. Failures and unknown history stay under review. Expiration pauses work and saves receipts.";
"Matched items skip original downloads and uploads. New unmatched items continue through checksum verification before backup." = "Matched items skip original downloads and uploads. New unmatched items continue through checksum verification before backup.";
"Photo Sync" = "Photo Sync";
"服务器暂不可用；已恢复本机保存的同步进度，连接恢复后可继续。" = "Server temporarily unavailable. Saved sync progress is restored locally; continue when connected.";
"Thumbnail unavailable offline" = "Thumbnail unavailable offline";
"服务器暂不可用，%lld 秒后继续（重试 %lld）；进度已保留，可随时暂停。" = "Server temporarily unavailable. Continuing in %lld seconds (retry %lld). Progress is saved; you can pause anytime.";
"照片同步的已验证匹配同时用于本机浏览，无需单独扫描；未匹配的新照片继续查重后备份。" = "Verified sync matches also enable local browsing, without a separate scan. New unmatched photos are checked for duplicates before backup.";
"使用照片同步的匹配结果，无需单独扫描。" = "Using verified photo sync matches. No separate scan is needed.";
"本机浏览设置暂未保存；照片同步队列保留。" = "Local browsing settings could not be saved. The photo sync queue is kept.";

/* Offline browsing restoration */
"正在补齐已完成项目的离线浏览关联；不会重新备份或下载原片。" = "Restoring offline browsing links for completed items. No originals will be downloaded or backed up again.";
"离线浏览关联已保存 %lld 项，已检查 %lld / %lld；备份完成记录保持不变。" = "Saved %lld offline browsing links; checked %lld / %lld. Completed backup records are unchanged.";
"本轮关联检查完成，已保存 %lld 项可离线浏览映射；未确认项目仍保留服务器显示，备份记录不变。" = "Link checks finished. Saved %lld offline browsing links; unconfirmed items keep server display. Backup records are unchanged.";
"离线浏览关联补齐已暂停；已保存部分可离线使用，备份完成记录保持不变。" = "Offline link restoration paused. Saved links work offline; completed backup records are unchanged.";
"离线浏览关联补齐已暂停；回到前台后从已保存进度继续。" = "Offline link restoration paused. Return to the app to continue from saved progress.";
"已保留离线浏览映射；每张照片由PhotoKit核对当前权限和版本，不依赖服务器重新匹配。" = "Offline links are preserved. PhotoKit checks each photo’s current permission and version without matching against the server again.";

